UID:124249-1794661200-1794672000@www.naturalsciences.org
SUMMARY:Art of Science: Himmeli and Documenting Phenology
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require pre-registration. Register for this program for adults\nThe Art of Science series is for adults who like to blend science and art. Each program will include hands-on experience with a citizen science project paired with an associated art project. Participants will take home their project\, supplies\, and any tools needed to complete the project. \nIn this program\, we will explore documenting phenology for science and make traditional Finnish winter ornaments called himmeli.  Instructions for collecting and submitting data and the himmeli project will be provided during the program – no experience required! Your program fee covers the supplies needed to make multiple himmeli. \n$22\, $20 Museum members
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/art-of-science-himmeli/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Collaborative Science,Outdoor Experiences
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Goforth":MAILTO:chris.goforth@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.812182885871;-78.713963528554
